12.787Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","bridgyOriginalText":"<p>iPhone Duo? – MacRumors</p><p>While the long-awaited foldable iPhone has often been referred to as the iPhone Ultra or the iPhone Fold in rumors, another name making the rounds is iPhone Duo. There is no actual evidence that Apple will use the iPhone Duo name, but it is certainly a possibility. Apple has used Duo branding in the past, for its PowerBook Duo line of laptops in the 1990s and for its MagSafe Duo Charger in the early 2020s.</p><p><a href=\"https://social.andyrush.net/iphone-duo-macrumors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">social.andyrush.net/iphone-duo</span><span class=\"invisible\">-macrumors/</span></a></p>","bridgyOriginalUrl":"https://mastodon.social/@andyrush/117215956809413716","createdAt":"2026-09-05T01:59:19.000Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.external","external":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.external#external","description":"","title":"Original post on mastodon.social","uri":"https://mastodon.social/@andyrush/117215956809413716"}},"langs":["en"],"text":"iPhone Duo? – MacRumors\n\nWhile the long-awaited foldable iPhone has often been referred to as the iPhone Ultra or the iPhone Fold in rumors, another name making the rounds is iPhone Duo. There is no actual evidence that Apple will use the iPhone Duo name, but it is certainly a possibility. Apple […]"},"embed":{"external":{"uri":"https://mastodon.social/@andyrush/117215956809413716","title":"Original post on mastodon.social","description":""},"$type":"app.bsky.embed.external#view"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-05T01:59:22.658Z","viewer":{"bookmarked":false,"threadMuted":false,"embeddingDisabled":false},"labels":[]}],"hitsTotal":4}
